{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: Agent基础概念MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"AI Agent 与普通 LLM 调用有什么本质区别？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent基础概念\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> fundamental\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/基础概念\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/fundamental</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">AI Agent 与普通 LLM 调用（如 ChatCompletion API）有什么本质区别？请从多个维度进行对比。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">普通 LLM 调用与 AI Agent 的本质区别在于：<strong>LLM 是被动的文本生成器，Agent 是主动的任务执行者</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>普通 LLM 调用</th>\n<th>AI Agent</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>工作模式</strong></td>\n<td>被动响应：输入 Prompt → 输出 Completion</td>\n<td>主动规划 + 执行：感知 → 规划 → 行动 → 反思</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>记忆能力</strong></td>\n<td>有限的上下文窗口（一次性）</td>\n<td>短期记忆（对话历史）+ 长期记忆（向量数据库）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>外部交互</strong></td>\n<td>几乎无，仅文本输入输出</td>\n<td>可调用工具（搜索、API、数据库、代码执行）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>自主性</strong></td>\n<td>低，完全依赖用户输入</td>\n<td>高，可自主决策下一步行动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>任务复杂度</strong></td>\n<td>简单问答、写作、翻译</td>\n<td>复杂多步任务（如\"帮我做竞品分析报告\"）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>状态性</strong></td>\n<td>无状态，每次调用独立</td>\n<td>有状态，维护内部状态（记忆、任务进度）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>工具使用</strong></td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>具备工具调用（Tool Use）能力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>核心差异详解：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>状态性（Stateful）</strong>：智能体拥有内部状态（记忆），能够记住历史交互、任务进度和环境信息。普通 LLM 调用每次独立，除非手动将历史拼入 Prompt。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>主动性（Proactive）</strong>：智能体可以自主决策下一步行动，而不是被动响应用户输入。它能自己决定\"该做什么\"。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>工具使用（Tool Use）</strong>：智能体能够调用外部工具（API、函数、数据库等）来获取信息或改变环境，突破了模型本身的知识和能力边界。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>多步推理（Multi-step Reasoning）</strong>：智能体通过循环机制，将一个复杂任务分解为多步子任务并逐步执行，可根据中间结果动态调整策略。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码对比：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># ===== 普通 LLM 调用 =====</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">normal_llm_call</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"一次性调用，无状态，无工具\"\"\"</span>\n    response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> client<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>chat<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>completions<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>create<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n        model<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        messages<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"role\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"user\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>choices<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># ===== AI Agent 调用 =====</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">agent_run</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"多步循环，有状态，有工具\"\"\"</span>\n    memory <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 记忆系统</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> step <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">range</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>max_steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 感知：组装上下文</span>\n        context <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> build_context<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 规划：LLM 思考下一步</span>\n        thought <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm_reasoning<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 执行：调用工具</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>requires_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            observation <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> execute_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>selected_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>parameters<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"step\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> step<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"thought\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"observation\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> observation<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 4. 完成：返回答案</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>final_answer\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"达到最大步数限制\"</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>一句话总结</strong>：LLM 是\"会说话\"，Agent 是\"会做事\"。LLM 是工具，Agent 是用工具的人。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：如果一个系统用了 LLM + RAG，它是 Agent 吗？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：不一定。如果只有 LLM + 知识检索，没有自主规划、工具调用和状态管理，本质上还是增强版的 LLM 调用，不是完整的 Agent。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：Agent 和 Workflow（工作流）有什么区别？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：Workflow 是固定步骤的预定义流程；Agent 是动态规划、根据中间结果自主调整执行路径的智能系统。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：用了 LangChain 就是 Agent</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：LangChain 是开发框架，是否构成 Agent 取决于是否具备四大组件（LLM + Planning + Memory + Tools）和自主决策能力</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关\" dir=\"auto\">相关</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a> — 返回主题导航</li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}